{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0ca735be55997e561d99e24f61fb5825a0f8248f1665c399e935deb9a7a0a264", "ja": "（今日は、次の公演のための撮影だが……\n琴葉、随分と気合いが入っているみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天的行程是为了下次公演的拍摄工作……\n琴叶感觉很有干劲呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "aa1bd03d716f414d3192b94efb3eaf7c0960bb13220f13bd17fac88d786f939f", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nすみません、途中で1回、NGを出してしまって。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n抱歉，我中途NG了一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "cfbdd7a179c62527e77584e8c32409e51045ccbcbb107c08e2e833186b507fbe", "ja": "本番までにもっと練習して、\n歌もダンスも完璧にしないと……。", "zh": "我得更加努力练习，\n在正式上场前把歌和舞蹈都练到完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "db9b59a530aa09032e5c1ba9e1dcd817fb1b61acf6ab6e2a36cf49b6914a8b71", "ja": "そんなに気にしなくて大丈夫だ。\nスタッフの人達も、いい仕事ぶりだって言ってたし。", "zh": "你不用那么担心啊。\n工作人员也都说你表现得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "e92e5b1ffb81f0c87a9677c4d50d7e2eea6db0c1a83f45575f3cb8512bfd3ad5", "ja": "えっ……本当ですか？　嬉しいな……。", "zh": "咦……真的吗？好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "e9aa10d2bf8238a2afe2ba24a0966fc1133a37c422fbf23e991f25e26de8beae", "ja": "私の調子がいいとしたら、きっと、\n{$P$}のおかげですね。", "zh": "如果大家觉得我状态好，\n肯定都是托了{$P$}的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ea2540fedbc41dbaebdbf8f63766a6762a7baaeb895f1548a0486a8c946ce069", "ja": "俺の？", "zh": "托我的福？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "ad982f92c0a64af791eeff09aaac07d71eeb2d3f2909fb72138b109e431134c3", "ja": "はい。この前の休日、買い物に付き合ってもらって……\nすごく、リフレッシュできたんです。", "zh": "是啊，之前休假时你陪我去买东西……\n让我好好充电了一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "33078a6ea5dc9b0270cd6bd97b4dd72e051ac02365ac6265e0a9ad2820aed23a", "ja": "普段はお休みの日も、やらなきゃいけない事ばかり\n考えてしまうんですけど……。", "zh": "平常就算放假，\n我还是会一直担心那些该做却还没做的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "f94fd9ebbca77185f59eb2d9122caca1f915d057749579036f79e4c360e0e419", "ja": "{$P$}のおかげで、\nすごく気分転換できました。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "但多亏{$P$}，\n我的心情放松了不少，真的很谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d0ff858b6dfa4a344477518e796d9558cbeffcc35facf90e20cbd712898b0bfd", "ja": "そうだったのか。真面目な琴葉らしいけど、\n休める時は、ちゃんと休まないとな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。虽然很像琴叶的认真作风，\n但该休息的时候，还是要好好休息喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "b0a381989ea55964a43885801a49beabf8c96541073c5fd2f1185519afbe1440", "ja": "はい。自分でも、わかってはいるんです。\nけど、どうしても考えてしまって……ダメですね、私。", "zh": "好的。其实这点我也很清楚，\n但总是忍不住会去想……我这样真的很不好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "4eeb927e535e520c49bc648c7449ec3f883df7ead2001567f60fb44a8f2065a6", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私がまた考え込んでいたら、注意してもらえますか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n如果我又开始钻牛角尖的话，你可以提醒我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "96754a09b683e4efee574ce8eba9698f500c340ec67b0a3e42944dc2ba19d353", "ja": "もちろん。しかし、琴葉は本当に真面目だな……。\nもっとわがままを言ってもいいと思うんだけど。", "zh": "当然好啊。不过，琴叶的个性真的很认真呢……\n我觉得你可以再任性一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "e265495abc732f95d29b29cab108253389241fe23e8420f1b1b2f6129564bc2e", "ja": "わがまま、ですか？　……うーん……。\nあっ、じゃあそれ、宿題にさせてください。", "zh": "任性吗？嗯……\n啊，那请让把我这件事当成回家作业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0033_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "c716b9f8e506adcb9564d701eddce730be5f922a458202aa03a0ea37c7f1657e", "ja": "次までに考えてきます、わがままなこと……\nど、どうして笑うんですか！？", "zh": "下次见面前，我会想好要怎么任性……\n你、你为什么在笑！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
